This plugin is an add-on to the Bank Tags plugin that ships with RuneLite. It
does not reproduce that plugin's tab strip, but it is written against it, and a
small amount of what it knows comes from that plugin's source, in particular
net.runelite.client.plugins.banktags.tabs.TabInterface:

  Copyright (c) 2018, Tomas Slusny <slusnucky@gmail.com>
  Copyright (c) 2018, Ron Young <https://github.com/raiyni>
  Copyright (c) 2023, Adam <Adam@sigterm.info>

What is derived is limited to the shape of the column that plugin builds (four
fixed widgets followed by a background and an icon for each tab, and the tab
width, height and gap), the condition used to detect a bank resize inside
[proc,bankmain_size_check], the menu op numbering, the convention that nulling
the dragged-on widget cancels a drop, and the name filter used when asking for
text.

